Quest 782 "[Crack of All Means] Reason for Contamination"
    Journal for karus "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Herga."
    Journal for elmorad "You must perform the mission assigned by [Advisor] Nez."
    Collect 4 of 508215000

Requires player level >= 52 and quest 781 is completed

Rewards
    Give 7500000 experience
    Give 1 of 900338000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "...  I ... think.. I'm getting the symptoms. Herga must know what to do."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "...  I ... think.. I'm getting the symptoms. Nez must know what to do."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "I've heard of the story again."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The person who seems to be infected are [haoong's Clan Warriors]. We have to get [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] to study further.\n\nCollect [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] following the order from Luferson Castle's Herga."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I've heard of the story again."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The person who seems to be infected are [haoong's Clan Warriors]. We have to get [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] to study further.\n\nCollect [Haoong Clan's Warrior Blood] following the order from Elmorad Castle's Nez."

On in_progress
    Say "You don't have enough. Hurry."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have it. Let's make sample.\n\nTake this [Haoong Clan Warrior Blood sample] to [Magic Association] Gator."
